    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.cursorword\n\n### Description\n\nI created a mapping to toggle vim.g.minicursorword_disable, but the change isn't applied immediately.\nIt's updated only on CursorMoved.\n\nHaving MiniCursorword.highlight as a public method (or highlight), may help in this and similar cases.\nAlternatively, mini.cursorword config may accept additional events for refreshing.",
